# Five instants make five page counters, so "{5}, {T}: Draw a card" costs {5} less: nothing but the {T}. Bot1 casts five Dark
# Rituals on turn 3 (Mox Jet's {B} starts the chain; each Ritual pays {B} and adds {B}{B}{B}, so eleven {B} float afterwards).
# Activating the Diary then must leave all eleven {B} in the pool: had it cost any mana it would have taken some. It draws
# a card (the library's Island) and is tapped.

